# Intermediate LaTeX output stays out of the repo; the built PDF does not.
# main.pdf is tracked deliberately so the draft can be read without a TeX
# install, and so reviewers see exactly the artefact the numbers were checked
# against. Rebuild with:
#   pdflatex main.tex && bibtex main && pdflatex main.tex && pdflatex main.tex
*.aux
*.bbl
*.blg
*.log
*.out
